ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260911/202609112323386107_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260911/202609112323386107_720.jpg"> </div><p>【姆巴佩专访】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-12/6aa4747b8fb5cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">小吧译言家|姆巴佩专访：我一直被视为天选之子 相信今年能拿金球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.76" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260912/202609120538094091_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.76" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.76" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260912/202609120538094091_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260912/202609120538094091_720.jpg"> </div><p>随着2026年金球奖候选名单出炉，皇马球星姆巴佩接受了来自金球奖主办方《法国足球》的专访。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-12/6aa456533d059native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">姆巴佩：相信今年能拿金球，没人比我好，27岁破梅西纪录不可思议</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.55" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260912/202609120330169779_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.55" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.55" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260912/202609120330169779_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260912/202609120330169779_1280.jpg"> </div><p>在专访中，姆巴佩与采访者详细谈到了今年金球奖的竞争话题，他表示，今年他相信自己能获奖。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-12/6aa45bc537421native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">姆巴佩：今年金球奖？我选自己，理解不同观点但我拿也不能算偷</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.46" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260912/202609120352045900.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.46" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.46" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260912/202609120352045900.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260912/202609120352045900.jpg"> </div><p>姆巴佩被问到了今年金球奖他的选择是谁，他笑着回应说选择自己。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-12/6aa45dcc567d7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">姆巴佩：金球奖应给特别的人，我的理解来自梅罗时代，我相信能赢</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.71" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260912/202609120402047205_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.71" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.71" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260912/202609120402047205_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260912/202609120402047205_1280.jpg"> </div><p>对于金球奖的选择标准，姆巴佩称这个奖项是为特别的人准备的，而他今年的表现，就称得上特别。</p><p>【其他新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-12/6aa4356f2aff7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">电讯报：阿森纳连续7年亏损并可能尝试削减成本 员工担忧会遭裁员</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.46" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260525/6a141c47c30cc.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.46" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.46" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260525/6a141c47c30cc.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260525/6a141c47c30cc.jpg"> </div><p>电讯报消息，阿森纳近期接触了一家咨询公司，准备在未来几个月实施削减成本的措施，一些员工开始担忧被裁员。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-12/6aa479f972410native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">爆发！19岁马斯坦托诺戴帽助紫百合取首胜，皇马4500万买下＆外租</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260912/202609120600478429.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260912/202609120600478429.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260912/202609120600478429.jpg"> </div><p>佛罗伦萨4-2威尼斯，取得新赛季以来在联赛的首场胜利！本场马斯坦托诺帽子戏法。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-12/6aa43f44ece58native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">默森：曼联今年进不了英超前5 他们引援不利导致阵容太过薄弱</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260911/6aa3129425e3d_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260911/6aa3129425e3d.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260911/6aa3129425e3d.jpg"> </div><p>天空体育消息，阿森纳名宿保罗·默森认为这赛季曼联不会进入前五。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-11/6aa42285269benative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：因凡蒂诺公布竞选FIFA主席口号“足球属于世界各地每个人</a>”</p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260401/69cd23be271b9.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260401/69cd23be271b9.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260401/69cd23be271b9.jpg"> </div><p>记者Rob Harris消息，因凡蒂诺已经公布自己竞选下届国际足联主席的口号，内容为“足球属于世界各地的每一个人”。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-12/6aa443bce4d9cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：斯卡洛尼希望国家队调整架构和工作方式，解决后再谈续约</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260715/6a56dba59e7e7.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260715/6a56dba59e7e7.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260715/6a56dba59e7e7.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷记者Veronica Brunati报道了斯卡洛尼合同情况的最新情况，他表示，续约谈判目前并没有进展，事实上，幕后有多个问题仍待解决。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-12/6aa45b4d6a88anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">费内巴切官方：主帅伊斯梅尔·卡尔塔尔将继续带队</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260911/202609110542013693.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div cla